sequenceDiagram
    %% Phase 7 — quant-divergence auto-flag in span_diff().
    %% Surfaces when same base model appears on two branches with
    %% different quant suffixes (silent quality regression).

    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant Diff as span_diff(left, right)
    participant BQP as _base_quant_pairs(spans)
    participant QFS as quant_from_span(span)
    participant PQ as parse_quant(model_name)
    participant Store as TraceStore

    Note over U,Store: Setup: trace T has two branches.<br/>Branch A used qwen2.5:7b-q4_K_M (cheap laptop)<br/>Branch B used qwen2.5:7b-q8_0 (VRAM-rich box).

    U->>Diff: span_diff(left_branch=A, right_branch=B)

    Note over Diff: ... existing per-span field diffs ...

    Diff->>BQP: _base_quant_pairs(left.spans)
    loop each LLM span
        BQP->>QFS: quant_from_span(span)
        QFS->>QFS: preferred: span.raw_attributes["rewind.local.quant"]
        alt attr missing
            QFS->>PQ: parse_quant(span.model_name)
            PQ-->>QFS: QuantInfo(label, bits)
        end
        QFS-->>BQP: QuantInfo
        Note over BQP: collect (strip_quant_suffix(model), quant) tuple
    end
    BQP-->>Diff: left_set = {("qwen2.5:7b", "q4_K_M")}

    Diff->>BQP: _base_quant_pairs(right.spans)
    BQP-->>Diff: right_set = {("qwen2.5:7b", "q8_0")}

    Note over Diff: For each left base, check if right side<br/>has same base but different quant.

    Diff->>Diff: bases_match = (qwen2.5:7b in both sets)
    Diff->>Diff: quants_diff = ("q4_K_M" ≠ "q8_0")
    Diff->>Diff: quant_diverges = bases_match AND quants_diff

    Diff-->>U: SpanDiff(..., quant_diverges=True)

    Note over U,Diff: UI surfaces a yellow 🔶 quant badge on the<br/>diverging span — silent model swap is caught.
